.TH "Docv::Span" "3cr" "2026-11-03" "docv 0.1.0" "docv API Reference"
.SH "NAME"
Docv::Span \- A run of text in one rendition.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "docv"\fR
.sp
\fBstruct Docv::Span\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
A run of text in one rendition. The text may hold spaces (breakable),
U+00A0 (unbreakable space) and tabs. \fIlink\fR is the number of the
span\(aqs link in \fB\%Document#links\fR, counted from 1; \fB\%0\fR for none.
.SH "CONSTRUCTORS"
.PP
\fBdef self.new(text : String, style : UInt16 = 0_u16, link : Int32 = 0)\fR
.SH "INSTANCE METHODS"
.PP
\fBdef link : Int32\fR
.PP
\fBdef style : UInt16\fR
.PP
\fBdef text : String\fR
.SH "DEFINED IN"
src/docv/ast.cr
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR "Docv" (3cr),
